            <description><![CDATA[<h3>What's new in 1.3</h3>
<ul>
  <li><b>Lifetime license.</b> DotStrip is now a one-time purchase, $9.99, with no subscription. If you already subscribe, nothing changes for you.</li>
  <li><b>Pink.</b> A new hot-pink color for the board, in the neon-sign spirit.</li>
  <li><b>One band, everything scrolling.</b> The shared band is now one continuous line that every widget takes its turn in: countdowns, now playing, weather, stocks and headlines, so you can have them all on at once.</li>
  <li><b>Custom timers.</b> A new Timers widget. Start a preset from the board or the menu, add your own lengths like 5m or 1h30m, and watch the countdown on the strip.</li>
  <li><b>Drag to resize.</b> Drag the seams between widgets, or between a graphic and the band, to make each one as wide as you want. Your sizes are remembered, and Reset Width puts them back.</li>
  <li><b>Smoother resizing.</b> Resizing no longer lags while you drag.</li>
  <li><b>High Contrast mode.</b> A brighter, bolder board that is easier to read.</li>
  <li><b>A tidier menu.</b> Settings are grouped under Board, Appearance and Widget Settings instead of one long list.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
